Canonical repository guidance: CLAUDE.md and CONTRIBUTING.md.
Authentication contract: docs/authentication.md.
Transport and session contract: docs/deployment.md.
Pagination and results: docs/usage.md.
Configuration: docs/configuration.md.
Tool schemas: src/tools.ts; regenerate docs/reference/tools.md with npm run docs:generate.

Preserve credential precedence, read-only enforcement, host pinning, bounded queues,
response limits, cancellation, and read-only retries. Never replay ambiguous writes.
Keep OAuth one-time state atomic and Redis encrypted; bind HTTP sessions to bearers.
Run relevant tests, typecheck, check:docs, and check:release. Use PRs for protected main.
